  "idx": 9
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "She seem real sweet.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 11
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "Look. It was in the fridge. The fridge is for everybody. That's the rules.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 13
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "It's on the paper. On the door.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 15
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "I was getting a head start.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 17
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "The pudding was mid, though.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 19
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "I'm just being honest. Two stars.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 21
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "Bet. I got you Friday.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 23
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "Right. And we good.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 25
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "You remember when you lost your wallet on Thursday?",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 27
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "I found it.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 29
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "Technically, I paid you back. You're welcome.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 31
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "So, what you bringing for lunch tomorrow?",
